      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section id=\"homereach-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 pb-24 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\" data-v-1c6297c3><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Home Reach</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">From confusing journeys to clearer choices</span></h1></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section id=\"homereach-hero-media\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><figure class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"content-image\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmoAAABXRUJQVlA4IF4AAAAQBQCdASogABcAPyl2tlOuJyUit/qoAcAlCUAYZorwbEjEls3Fu1U1UHecFvV4hVgAAP7f+FuRyAKzPGg5TpGX2a0PPxRLJx8n0GoxF5k1+5CBZQFU0tubT6sWmAAA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen.avif 1728w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen.webp 1728w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/homereach/hero.gen.webp\" alt=\"Home Reach homepage hero with property search and eligibility check\" class=\"block w-full h-auto content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></figure></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Home Reach wanted to make it easier for prospective buyers to understand Shared Ownership, find the right information and take the next step towards home ownership.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>We worked across UX, design, development and website optimisation to simplify key journeys, improve property pages and make useful content easier to find. The work also addressed the technical and operational issues behind the experience, helping make the website easier to maintain and more reliable.</span></p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-why\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\" data-v-c2ba827a>The challenge</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Shared Ownership can be difficult for prospective buyers to navigate. People need to understand how it works, what they can afford, whether they're eligible and which properties are right for them.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Home Reach's existing website created friction in that journey. Navigation involved too many clicks, the proposition wasn't always clear enough, and parts of the interface felt dated or inconsistent across desktop and mobile.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>The challenge was to make the experience clearer and more intuitive without disrupting the existing website, connected systems or customer journeys.</span></p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section id=\"homereach-resource-hub-media\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><figure class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"content-image\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRqQAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAIwAAQUxQSCUAAAABR6AgbQPGv+P92YiIeO4hNMgELNZBIyU0El0AV0T/JyBidv8CAFZQOCBYAAAAMAUAnQEqIAAkAD8pfLJTriekorVIAcAlCWUA0nAs2sv4eOtE53AfWtnuIgBmJm16cAAA/sXjtMcFEgfPnr4OJTPsFR/WJ8T9DiJviZhxFE0tdkDDhoAAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen.avif 1843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen.webp 1843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/homereach/resource-hub.gen.webp\" alt=\"Home Reach resource hub page explaining Shared Ownership, with guide cards and a comparison against renting and buying\" class=\"block w-full h-auto content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></figure></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-how\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\" data-v-c2ba827a>What we built</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>We used analytics, user behaviour, and Hotjar findings to identify where people were encountering friction and prioritise improvements.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>The work included:</span></p><ul class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor mb-6 pl-6 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc\" data-v-34ac1b0d><li data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Simplifying key journeys: reducing unnecessary navigation and creating clearer routes to property searches, eligibility information and enquiries.</span></li><li data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Improving property pages: bringing important information, including pricing, share options, eligibility and enquiry calls to action, further into focus.</span></li><li data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Improving the mobile experience: making key information and next steps easier to access on smaller screens.</span></li><li data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Making the website easier to manage: improving CMS behaviour, property-status handling, redirects and error-page management to reduce manual intervention.</span></li><li data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Structuring useful content: developing dedicated areas for blogs, customer stories, webinars and events, and FAQs to help people find relevant information throughout their journey.</span></li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>The work also accounted for the systems behind the experience, including Zoho forms, marketing consent, cookie consent, analytics and property data.</span></p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section id=\"homereach-property-page-media\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><figure class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"content-image\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRogAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAADwAAQUxQSB8AAAABJ0CQbePPvO3XiIj4EhBmG1VlLOfPdt+I/gcA0P4CAFZQOCBCAAAA0AMAnQEqIAAQAD85XslfLyOqphgB4CcJYwABHk8G+vgqnbOmG5IAAP7wGre6U0IxxdEmEue/rQ71VlL6whGNsgAA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-1920w.avif 1920w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen.avif 1922w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen-1920w.webp 1920w, /content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen.webp 1922w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/homereach/property-page.gen.webp\" alt=\"Home Reach property page with image gallery, share price breakdown and register interest call to action\" class=\"block w-full h-auto content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></figure></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-results\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\" data-v-c2ba827a>The impact</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>The work addressed friction across the customer journey, from understanding Shared Ownership to finding a property and making an enquiry. It also gave Home Reach clearer ways to organise and present useful content, alongside technical improvements to support day-to-day website management.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>The approach was grounded in observed user behaviour rather than design assumptions alone, helping prioritise improvements around the information people need and the actions they want to take.</span></p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-why-it-matters\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\" data-v-c2ba827a>Why it matters</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>For shared-ownership providers, the website is more than a property showcase. It's where prospective buyers learn how the scheme works, assess their options and decide whether to take the next step.</span></p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>A clearer digital experience can make that journey easier to navigate while giving marketing and sales teams a stronger foundation for attracting and converting prospective buyers.</span></p></div></div></section></div>"
    },
