      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-c2ba827a><section id=\"homereach-services-used\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-6 max-md:py-4 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><div class=\"body-content body-content--markdown flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p>Our work with Home Reach demonstrates how focused UX improvements, better content structure and practical technical changes can work together to improve the digital experience within an existing platform. Explore the full range of <a href=\"/services\">Fyntix services</a>.</p>\n</div></div></section></div>"
